Image Peek adapts code from claude-image-view by Jarrod Watts
(https://github.com/jarrodwatts/claude-image-view): the image search that finds
the [Image #N] tags in the prompt and the cached file behind each one
(hooks/register.tsx), and the tile layout (hooks/layout.ts). That code is used
under its own license:

